#. module: theme_bewise
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_bewise.s_quotes_carousel_minimal
msgid ""
"\" A leading institution for growth. <br/>Supportive, forward-thinking, and "
"academically rigorous. \""
msgstr ""
"\" Водеща институция за развитие. <br/>Подкрепяща, прогресивна и академично "
"взискателна. \""

#. module: theme_bewise
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_bewise.s_quotes_carousel_minimal
msgid ""
"\" Outstanding education and support! <br/>They consistently exceed my "
"expectations. \""
msgstr ""
"\" Изключително обучение и подкрепа! <br/>Постоянно надминават очакванията "
"ми. \""

#. module: theme_bewise
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_bewise.s_quotes_carousel_minimal
msgid ""
"\" Their programs transformed my career. Innovative, challenging, and "
"inspiring. \""
msgstr ""
"\" Техните програми преобразиха кариерата ми. Иновативни, предизвикателни и "
"вдъхновяващи. \""

